sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin/owner
  participant D as Repository docs
  participant S as Application
  participant DB as Database
  A->>D: Approve authentication ADR
  D-->>S: Authorization requirements
  S->>DB: Validate future session (PROPOSED)
  DB-->>S: Session result
  S-->>A: Authorized admin response
  Note over A,DB: No admin auth or session model is implemented today
